  "summary_en": "NASA's final rule (14 CFR Part 1216) setting procedures to implement the National Environmental Policy Act: when NEPA applies, categorical exclusions, environmental assessments and impact statements, page and time limits, agency roles, and sponsor-prepared documents. Unmanned aircraft appear only incidentally in categorical exclusions.",
